oration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:50:21Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "What a question, great lurn for me", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:50:30Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "The first man who flew his plane “in public viewing”", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:50:30Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "they merged their companies later", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:50:44Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Curtiss-Wright was the name of the company for a while", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:51:02Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Pavan 20", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:51:23Z", "username": "bijal bhatt", "text": "But the brothers said that curt is worng", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]